# Reactive Surface Phase 7-A Report

Builder verdict: **PASS**. User visual gate: **PENDING**.

## Results

| Check | Result | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Demo test materials | PASS | Grass and Snow materials now call their channel material functions; Puddle samples Water RT. |
| Ground sleep hold | PASS | Nonzero `19 -> 19` while sleeping. |
| Ground recenter | PASS | Observed `[64, 0] px`, error `[0, 0] px`. |
| Water wake guard | PASS | Four Event Tick wake paths use `IsActive`; temp and production SIE had zero ensure/infinite-loop/BP errors. |
| Packaged three-channel activation | PASS | Grass, Ground, and Water Niagara components were all Active at frame 180. |
| Packaged integrated cost | PASS | 300-frame on/off GameThread median delta `0.02885 ms` (`<= 1.0 ms`). |
| Compile/audit/dirty | PASS | BP `0/0`, Niagara `0/0`, MCP hits `0`, dirty `0`. |

## PIE Visual Gate

1. Open `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Demo/L_RS_Demo` and press PIE without a runner.
2. Move the Piper character with WASD across the grass, snow, and water areas.
3. Confirm the Grass plane shows a directional trail, the Ground plane preserves footprints through movement/recenter, and the Water plane shows propagated rings without a fixed tail.
4. Confirm no `Ensure condition failed`, `Infinite loop detected`, `Accessed None`, or Blueprint runtime error appears.

